     ~/mbox                   your old mail
     ~/.mailrc                file giving initial mail commands
     /tmp/R#                  temporary for editor escape
     /usr/lib/Mail.help*      help files
     /usr/lib/Mail.rc         system initialization file
     /bin/mail                to do actual mailing
     /etc/delivermail         postman

